MFLOW 2
NAME Circuit: star-delta starter
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 SB1 starts KM1; KM2 joins it: the motor runs\nin star (low current). T1 counts 5 s, then\nits NC opens (KM2 off) and its NO closes\n(KM3 on): delta, full power. Both motor\nloads drive Blower01.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Hold SB1 and watch H1 (star), then H2\n(delta). Change T1 in Properties.\nFault Blower01: OL1 trips everything.

